# The free demo's configuration: who ships it, and where they live.
#
# Every page renders from fixtures in its own file, so there is no API to point at, no database, no
# auth and nothing secret. Its own URL is not configuration either.
#
# The footer is the exception. A buyer shipping this template is not Viliha, and saying so should be
# two keys rather than a component edit, which is the difference between a template and a fork. The
# name is rendered verbatim: casing is part of how a company writes its own name.
#
# `VITE_` is the prefix Vite exposes to the browser, and only that prefix. These were
# `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_NAME` and `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` when this was a Next app.
VITE_SITE_NAME=
VITE_SITE_URL=
